  "src": "non-black pixels of a periodic color field with black missing-cell masks",
  "transform": "infer the maximally supported self-translation whose overlapping visible pixels agree, then fill every black pixel from the unique color in its translation-equivalence class"
}
</annotation>
</reference_puzzle>

